        <p class='case-subtitle'>
          A lively dog-agility blog designed to make articles easy to discover, read, and manage.
        </p>

        <dl class='case-summary' aria-label='Project summary'>
          <div>
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>Brand, UX/UI, and interaction design</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
